    "updated_at": "2026-11-16T00:05:55Z",
    "body": "Looks already done or split on `upstream/main` `c86d6db3`. Suggest closing; the maintainer decides.\n\nShipped work on `upstream/main`:\n\n- **Generator and stand-alone operation (PR #563, `0fbf5799`):** `trochoid_slot.rs` and `trochoid_loops.rs` plan front-arc loops controlled by `quality::measure`. `OpType::TrochoidalSlot` supports create, edit, undo, project round-trip, selection confinement (PR #1513, `43ee00d2`), part depth checks (PR #1597, `d5a8c518`), and opened start bores (PR #1662, `1f6a74be`).\n- **2D Adaptive `Method = Trochoidal` (PR #1598, `1943a22a`, `#1509`):** Maintainer direction placed trochoidal mode on Adaptive operations (`AdaptiveMethod::Spiral` or `Trochoidal`). PR #1788 (`6c33940d`, `#1587`) added parallel lanes, closed island rings, and corner clean-up in `adaptive_troch_lanes.rs`, `adaptive_troch_slice.rs`, and `adaptive_troch_clean.rs`. PR #1782 (`8b366d65`, `#1588`) exposed `max_engagement`, `ret`, `return_feed`, and `loop_width` in `adaptive_troch.rs`, `kind_editors.rs`, project JSON, and MCP.\n- **Pins and goldens:** `crates/motion/tests/trochoid_slot.rs` tests full-width loops under the engagement limit against a 180-degree straight slot, tight limits, verifier warnings, microlift air landings, and narrow refusals. `crates/motion/src/machining2d/adaptive_troch_tests.rs` and `crates/app/tests/adaptive_trochoid.rs` test wide pockets, L-shapes, islands, acute corners, corner clean-up under engagement limits, and CL goldens (`adaptive2d_trochoidal_pocket_face.cl`, `adaptive2d_trochoidal_wide.cl`, `adaptive2d_trochoidal_l_shape.cl`, `adaptive2d_trochoidal_island.cl`). `crates/post/tests/fanuc_post.rs` tests `trochoid_slot_small.nc` with `G02`/`G03` arcs.\n- **Decision record:** `RECOMMENDED.md` (`#220` slice 1) documents why in-plane cutting returns were dropped under the verifier crossing law.\n\nRemaining items live in dedicated open issues:\n\n- `#1591` (`P4`): 3D Adaptive `Method` choice (`Spiral` or `Trochoidal`) per level.\n- `#1590` (`P8`): Stand-alone `Trochoidal slot` operation's future.\n- `#1523` (`P7`): Shared `SlotBound` law for two-edge picking on `Trochoidal slot`.\n- `#5`, `#6`, `#47` (`blocked`): Internal trochoidal fallback inside the HSM spiral planner.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
