    "body": "Issue sweep: partly done on `upstream/main` (`7c99d1bc8`).\n\nSince the previous comment, 3D Adaptive `Method = Trochoidal` merged in `475373093` (PR #2704, #1591). Items 1, 3, 4, and three of the four pins in item 5 are on `upstream/main`.\n\nTwo items from \"Done means\" remain open:\n\n- Item 2: Adaptive does not switch from a spiral path to trochoidal loops inside overloaded slots or corners. The decision on #1509 shipped `Method = Spiral | Trochoidal` on 2D Adaptive (PR #1598, #1788, #1782) and 3D Adaptive (PR #2704). The spiral fallback stays open in #5, #6, and #47.\n- Item 5 (second pin): no test shows a spiral path overloading a corner while a trochoidal path holds the limit. The corner tests in `crates/motion/tests/adaptive_troch_neck.rs` and `crates/motion/tests/adaptive_troch_parallel.rs` measure trochoidal engagement and rest area only.\n\nThe maintainer decides whether the shipped `Method` design and issues #5, #6, and #47 close this issue.\n",
